            "content": "<p>They prove that innovation doesn’t just happen in chemistry labs or in boardrooms. For them, innovation happened at home, over time spent cooking dinner together, sharing a morning coffee, and sitting on the couch after a long day. <br/><br/>Together, they created Signature Society. A brand built on craftsmanship, innovation and an uncompromising commitment to quality.</p>"
