        "richtext_LDdJrw": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We come from a long line of passionate entrepreneurs, people who worked tirelessly to bring powerful, great ideas to life. That spirit lives in us, too, acting as a guiding light that inspired us to create products which make life easier, more beautiful, and undeniably better.<br/><br/>Every detail, every material, every element of design is considered with care, because we believe luxury isn’t just about how something looks, but how it feels.</p>"
